OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFog forming
OL,6,Freadily given light winds and
OL,7,Fdeveloping clear spells, perhaps
OL,8,Fbecoming locally dense, with local
OL,9,Ffrost also possible. Locally heavy
OL,10,Fshowers near southern coastal
OL,11,Fdistricts should clear offshore during
OL,12,Fthe evening to leave a drier remainder
OL,13,Fof the night.
OL,14,
OL,15,CSunday:FWidely a chilly and murky
OL,16,Fstart, with mist and fog only slowly
OL,17,Flifting and clearing towards
OL,18,Flunchtime. Some eventual sunny spells
OL,19,Fthen developing. Winds staying light,
OL,20,Fwith near-normal temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
