OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FProbably dry but rather cloudy Monday
OL,7,Fafter a murky start with some fog.
OL,8,FBreezier Tuesday, with periods of rain
OL,9,Fmaking progress northeast, with
OL,10,Ffurther rain likely Wednesday.
OL,11,FTemperatures edging upwards.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
